    rdfs:label "Charnia masoni apical Turing wavelength at 140 µm (565 Ma), pass 1 (Charnia masoni)",
        "Charnia masoni apical Turing wavelength at 140 µm (565 Ma), pass 1 faithfully reproduces Charnia masoni morphology" ;
